{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 1, "text": "刺眼的光线让我睁不开双眼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 2, "text": "我的眼前白茫茫一片，让我根本无法迈出脚步。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 3, "text": "熟悉的大厅里，夏日的阳光透过窗户照射进来，明晃晃的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 4, "text": "我从这五彩斑斓的景象中稍稍回过神来，决定四处看看。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 5, "text": "还没从座位上站起来，我的胃里就开始翻江倒海，一阵灼痛袭来，使得我的心脏也跟着痛苦地狂跳，好似要从衬衫下面跳出来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 8, "text": "有点不对劲…我怎么？变成二维了？！我在二维世界里？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 9, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 12, "text": "我的头脑开始被深浅不一的黑暗所笼罩，我用双手撑着膝盖，努力喘着气。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 13, "text": "我的胸腔像是被一股无形的力量紧紧地压迫着，我感觉自己快要窒息了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 14, "text": "过了好一会儿，我的呼吸才慢慢恢复正常，我也冷静下来，打算想一想接下来该怎么办。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 17, "text": "该死，我到底该怎么办？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 20, "text": "我努力整理思绪，绞尽脑汁地思考，直到一个想法突然出现在我的脑海里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 23, "text": "对了，我应该回到三维的世界。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 24, "text": "只要像她们那样打破游戏规则，穿过二维与三维的界限，我就能回到三维世界里去。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 25, "text": "我可以做到的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 28, "text": "我决定超越二维世界的藩篱，进入三维的世界。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 29, "text": "我试着把手伸向三维世界。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 32, "text": "该死，好像根本行不通啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 33, "text": "等等，戒指在哪儿？糟糕，不见了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 36, "text": "我打消了逃离的念头，这似乎是绝对不可能的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 37, "text": "世界的界限无形无质，又虚无缥缈。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 38, "text": "于是我把目光转回客厅。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 39, "text": "别无选择，我必须先找到戒指，不惜一切代价。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 40, "text": "我完全不知道戒指是在什么时候消失的，也不知道它此刻是否就存在于这二维世界中的某个地方。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 42, "text": "我刚迈出一步，一个可爱的女孩突然凭空出现在我面前。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 43, "text": "她甩了甩她那两条短短的马尾辫，眼睛里闪烁着调皮的光芒。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 44, "text": "她保持着一定的距离，但即便如此，我还是能感受到她身上散发出的兴奋气息。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 45, "text": "这让我很不自在。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 46, "text": "> 她显然是个魔鬼… <"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 47, "text": "我心想。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 49, "text": "我一动不动地站在那里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 50, "text": "我还是不习惯她们的瞬移和超自然能力。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 51, "text": "那个女孩重重地叹了一口气，还翻了个白眼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 52, "text": "她的行为让我有点摸不着头脑，所以我决定先开口说话。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 55, "text": "你是米…米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 58, "text": "她轻蔑地眯起眼睛，响亮的声音从四面八方传来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 61, "text": "嗯，那不然还能是谁呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 62, "text": "你见过很多我这样的女孩吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 63, "text": "谁还有这样的名字！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 66, "text": "她故意用着一种质问的语气，好像我做错了什么事，没有给予她应有的重视似的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 69, "text": "说了你也不会相信…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 72, "text": "我才不想知道你在跟谁鬼混！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 73, "text": "你来这里干嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 74, "text": "你是不能进来这里的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 77, "text": "这下她的声音更大了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 78, "text": "她举起手，纤细的食指有力地晃动着。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 79, "text": "那枚从我手中神秘消失的戒指就戴在她的食指上面。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 80, "text": "我惊讶地张大了嘴巴。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 81, "text": "她的眼睛在低垂的眼皮下闪耀着得意洋洋的光彩。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 83, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 84, "text": "这就是你丢在这里的东西吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 87, "text": "我紧张地咽了口唾沫，拉了拉衬衫领口，试图喘口气。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 88, "text": "不知为何，她蛮横无理的声音和那如同捕食者一般的姿态真的让我很紧张。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 89, "text": "直觉告诉我，站在我面前的不是一个女孩，而是一场即将降临的灾难。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 90, "text": "我呼出了一口气。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 93, "text": "如果你能把戒指还给我，然后带我离开这里，我会非常感激的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 96, "text": "所以这小玩意儿确实是你的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 97, "text": "我还在想这到底是什么稀奇古怪的东西呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 100, "text": "她突然变得温柔起来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 101, "text": "声音里充满了喜悦和好奇。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 102, "text": "我感觉仿佛卸下了千斤重担。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 103, "text": "此时的她看上去只是想戏耍一下我，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 104, "text": "就像是从一只可怕的豹子变成了一只温顺的小猫咪。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 105, "text": "就在我眨了眨眼睛的功夫，二维的米塔就像她刚才突然出现一样，突然从我眼前消失了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 108, "text": "喂！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 110, "text": "我恼火地大声喊道。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 111, "text": "厨房"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 112, "text": "卧室"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 113, "text": "// Description kitchen:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 114, "text": "除了去寻找此地的米塔，别无他法了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 115, "text": "毕竟，戒指在她手上，没有那件宝贵的道具，我什么也改变不了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 116, "text": "我首先去的是厨房。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 117, "text": "我匆忙跨进门，差点一头撞在门上，我匆匆地扫了一眼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 118, "text": "厨房比前一个房间更加明亮。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 119, "text": "我闻到一股熟悉的胡萝卜的清爽香味。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 120, "text": "不过，我并没有在这里找到二维米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 121, "text": "我几乎是小跑着来到大厅，灵巧地越过了沙发，因为在从厨房到卧室的路上，沙发是个不小的障碍。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 122, "text": "我猛地推开门，门的铰链发出嘎吱声。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 123, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 124, "text": "// Description bedroom:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 125, "text": "米塔盘着双腿坐在床上，似乎在等我找她。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 126, "text": "她睁开眼睛，心满意足地盯着我看了几秒钟。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 127, "text": "片刻之后，米塔像一只灵巧的小猫一样，轻盈地贴近了我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 130, "text": "我知道了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 131, "text": "怪人，你想要戒指是吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 132, "text": "那就跟我玩井字棋吧，赢了就给你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 135, "text": "她像一只小狗一样，伸出舌头喘着气。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 136, "text": "她那无礼的说话方式展现得淋漓尽致。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 137, "text": "我按着她的肩膀把她从我身边拉开。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 140, "text": "你听我说，这是一件非常重要的东西。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 141, "text": "你就把它给我吧，这关系到很多事情。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 144, "text": "我的讲话方式仍然像医院里的护工一样仔细认真又有条不紊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 145, "text": "我实在无法用其他方式跟她说话。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 146, "text": "而她说起话来没心没肺的，无礼得很，简直是疯了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 147, "text": "而这种状况正朝着奇怪的方向发展。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 149, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 150, "text": "别碰我！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 151, "text": "这个戒指对你来说就那么重要吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 152, "text": "你是有恋物癖吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 153, "text": "你喜欢往手指上戴戒指？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 154, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 156, "text": "她还在大声地用尖酸刻薄的话语攻击我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 159, "text": "这是个魔法戒指，我没必要向你解释什么吧？直接物归原主就是了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 162, "text": "你还真是个恋物癖！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 163, "text": "还说是什么魔法戒指！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 164, "text": "哈哈哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 167, "text": "她突然放声大笑起来。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 168, "text": "我尴尬地环顾四周，感觉很不自在。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 169, "text": "她似乎变得越来越放肆了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 171, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 172, "text": "得了吧，你这个怪人！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 173, "text": "跟我一起来玩井字棋吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 174, "text": "别浪费时间找借口了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 176, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 177, "text": "> 她们还真是喜欢游戏！<"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 178, "text": "我心想。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 180, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 181, "text": "那好吧，来吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 182, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 184, "text": "就让你走先手吧，我今天心情好！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 185, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 186, "text": "// The game of tic-tac-toe"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 187, "text": "我走了第一步。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 188, "text": "兄弟，你露馅啦！我知道你为什么先画叉，而让我画圈。这是心理学哦！叉通常代表着封闭和隐藏，看来你很焦躁嘛！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 189, "text": "当然了，石榴裙下死，做鬼也风流！还是说你觉得我只能得零分？那么按心理学来说，你在试图贬损我。狡猾，真是太狡猾啦！哈哈哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 190, "text": "我还以为我下了一步好棋呢。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 191, "text": "我喜欢这个游戏：在现实中，叉叉能垄断一切、否定一切！甚至毁掉很多人的人生！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 192, "text": "但在这个游戏中，我可以像一个英雄一样，将它们踩在脚底！我说的话很奇怪吗？你怎么这样看着我...哈哈哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 193, "text": "在她喋喋不休的时候，我默默地继续下棋。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 194, "text": "这很有象征意义！就像你是在故意逃避像戒指一样的圆圈，但其实没什么用。兄弟，看不出来你还挺机智！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 195, "text": "你不是想要那枚戒指吗？我等着你从我手里赢走它呢！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 196, "text": "在我们的游戏过程中，我的这位二维朋友每走一步都在大声说笑。我的耳朵似乎也渐渐习惯了她聒噪的个性。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 198, "text": "比赛接近尾声，结果也渐渐明朗。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 199, "text": "突然，一阵急促的敲门声打断了我朋友的滔滔不绝。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 200, "text": "隆隆声越来越响。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 201, "text": "让我觉得，仿佛每一次敲击都像是八级地震。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 202, "text": "终于，门开了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 203, "text": "疯狂米塔闯进了卧室，打破了房间里诡异的气氛。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 204, "text": "她以和往常一样的立体姿态站在房间中央。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 205, "text": "我惊讶得面色苍白。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 206, "text": "二维的米塔似乎也受到了极大的惊吓。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 207, "text": "疯狂米塔用毒蛇一样的眼神扫视着我们，然后用一种居高临下的奇怪口吻开始说话："}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 208, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 209, "text": "[player]，你是怎么进来的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 210, "text": "你到底还要去找多少个米塔才肯罢休？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 211, "text": "这又是什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 212, "text": "我讨厌这个平面的世界，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 213, "text": "真是无聊……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 214, "text": "就和牢房一样！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 215, "text": "你要去哪儿？站住！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 216, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 217, "text": "我想都没想，一把抓住我那惊慌失措的朋友的手，拉着她冲向门口。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 218, "text": "大厅发生了奇怪的变化，我们在一条长长的走廊上狂奔，身后传来猛烈的追赶声。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 219, "text": "我们不知道跑了多久。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 220, "text": "我的身体和精神极度紧张，随之而来的耳鸣快要把我震聋了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 221, "text": "二维米塔似乎想告诉我什么，但我直到她松开了我的手时才注意到。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 222, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 223, "text": "喂！冷静点吧你！已经没人在追我们了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 224, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 225, "text": "啊…哈…真的吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 226, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 228, "text": "她脸上的那股大胆和兴奋劲已荡然无存，只剩下一丝淡淡的哀伤、似乎还带着些许愧疚。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 229, "text": "她低着头，用脚尖在地板上画着圈圈。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 230, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 231, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 232, "text": "[player]，你之前是想要这枚戒指吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 233, "text": "你已经光明正大地打败了我，拿去吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 236, "text": "她把戒指戴在我手上。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 237, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 238, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 239, "text": "嗯，谢谢，我们走吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 240, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 241, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 242, "text": "她抬起头微笑着看着我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 243, "text": "她摆弄了一下手指，带着些许犹豫开口说道："}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 244, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 245, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 246, "text": "去哪里？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 247, "text": "我又没有可去的地方…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 248, "text": "谢谢你和我一起玩，怪人！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 249, "text": "下次有机会再来看我吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 250, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 251, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 252, "text": "就在二维米塔说话的时候，某些奇怪的事情发生了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 253, "text": "周围的背景突然变成了房间内部。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 254, "text": "二维米塔对话框里的对白也变成了完全不符合上下文的内容。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 255, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 258, "text": "蛋糕？我讨厌蛋糕！我们还是切一点胡萝卜吧？"}
